# What graphify should not put in the knowledge graph.
#
# IMPORTANT — why this file duplicates .gitignore instead of just adding to it:
# graphify's README says .graphifyignore is *merged* with .gitignore, but
# Graphify-Labs/graphify#1363 reports it actually *replaces* it — a directory
# containing a .graphifyignore stops having its .gitignore read at all. That
# issue was verified on 0.8.40 and closed with no stated fix; we're on 0.9.55,
# so we don't rely on either behaviour. Every .gitignore pattern is repeated
# here, which is correct under both: if it merges, the duplicates are inert;
# if it replaces, nothing is silently re-included.
#
# The consequence of getting this wrong is not cosmetic — .env.local holds the
# real Supabase service-role key and the Cloudflare R2 credentials. Those must
# never end up in graph.json.
#
# If you add a pattern to .gitignore, add it here too.

# --- the actual reason this file exists ------------------------------------
# ui-ux-pro-max is a vendored design-reference skill, not our code. Extracting
# it put 467 of 1134 nodes (41% of the graph) into its Python test fixtures,
# and polluted real queries: asking about home_sections returned
# test_data_contracts.py and parse_decision_rules(). Nothing in here is ever
# the answer to a question about this codebase.
.claude/skills/

